"The mighty Pacu refuses to explain its philosophy. It simply embodies it."
msgstr "الباسو القوي يرفض شرح فلسفته. إنه يجسدها ببساطة."

msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_SCULPTURE_WOOD_AMAZING_ACTION_GULP.NAME"
msgid "Stoic Trophy"
msgstr "كأس رزين"

msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_SCULPTURE_WOOD_AMAZING_ACTION_PACU.DESC"
msgid ""
"Duplicants like to prank their friends by sticking their hands inside and "
"pretending the sculpture has come to life."
msgstr ""
"يحب النسخ المزاح مع أصدقائهم عن طريق إدخال أيديهم والتظاهر بأن التمثال قد "
"أصبح حيا."

