msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_TOP_GOTCH_DUSKY_GRAPE.DESC"
msgid ""
"A sweat-wicking undershirt in a twilight shade of purple, for colonists who "
"haven't seen the sun in a very long time."
