msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.INVESTIGATIONS.DLC2_NEWBABY.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid ""
"Director, this was sent to the general inbox.\n"
"\n"
"-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n"
"<indent=35%>~ * ~</indent>\n"
"\n"
"<indent=12%>Col. Josephine Carnot & Dr. Alan Stern</indent>\n"
"<indent=35%>and</indent>\n"
"<indent=12%>Dr. Kyung Min Wen & Dr. Soobin Chen</indent>\n"
"\n"
"<indent=20%><i>are overjoyed to announce\n"
"<indent=15%>the arrival of their first grandchild</i></indent>\n"
"\n"
"<smallcaps><indent=20%><b><size=17>Giselle Jackie-Lin Stern</size></b></indent></smallcaps>\n"
"\n"
"<indent=15%><i>and congratulate the happy parents</i></indent>\n"
"\n"
"<indent=20%>Jonathan Stern & Wenlin Chen</indent>\n"
"\n"
"<indent=18%><i>on a safe and healthy incubation.</i></indent>\n"
"\n"
"<indent=35%>~ * ~</indent>\n"
"\n"
"</indent><indent=18%><i>Baby shower invitation to follow.</i></indent>\n"
"-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n"
"\n"
"Would you like me to file it with the others?"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n"
"\n"
"مدير، تم إرسال هذا إلى صندوق البريد العام.<indent=35%>~ * ~</indent>\n"
"\n"
"<indent=12%>العقيدة جوزيفين كارنو والدكتور أالن ستيرن</indent>\n"
"<indent=35%>و</indent>\n"
"<indent=12%>الدكتور كيونغ مين وين والدكتورة سوبين تشن</indent>\n"
"\n"
"<indent=20%><i>\n"
"يسعدهم أن يعلنوا عن<indent=15%>وصول أول حفيد لهم</i></indent>\n"
"\n"
"<smallcaps><indent=20%><b><size=17>جيسيل جاكي-لين ستيرن</size></b></indent></smallcaps>\n"
"\n"
"<indent=15%><i>ويهنوئن الوالدين السعيدين</i></indent>\n"
"\n"
"<indent=20%>جوناثان ستيرن ووينلين تشن</indent>\n"
"\n"
"<indent=18%><i>على والدة آمنة وصحية.</i></indent>\n"
"\n"
"<indent=35%>~ * ~</indent>\n"
"\n"
"</indent><indent=18%><i>سيتم إرسال دعوة لحفل استقبال المولود الحقا.</i></indent>هل ترغب أن أقوم بحفظها مع الملفات األخرى؟\n"
"\n"
"-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n"

