msgid ""
"A picky little Sanishell Spawn.\n"
"\n"
"In time it will mature into a fully grown <link=\"CRABFRESHWATER\">Sanishell</link>."
msgstr ""
"مع الوقت سينضج ليصبح \n"
"\n"
"كلب صغير صعب اإلرضاء.<link=\"CRABFRESHWATER\">سانيشيل</link>."

