msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.PREHISTORICPACU.BABY.DESC"
msgid ""
"A grumpy little Jawbo fry.\n"
"\n"
"In time, it will grow into a toothy <link=\"PREHISTORICPACU\">Jawbo</link>."
msgstr ""
"مع مرور الوقت، سينمو ليصبح \n"
"\n"
"صغير obwaJ غاضب.<link=\"PREHISTORICPACU\">obwaJ</link> ذو أسنان."

