msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.SQUIRREL.VARIANT_HUG.BABY.DESC"
msgid ""
"A fuzzy little Cuddle Pipsqueak.\n"
"\n"
"In time it will mature into a fully grown <link=\"SQUIRREL\">Cuddle Pip</link>."
msgstr ""
