"Ovagro Vines are plants that produce edible <link=\"VINEFRUIT\">Ovagro Fig</link>.\n"
"\n"
"If a vine is cut off from its <link=\"VINEMOTHER\">Ovagro Node</link>, it will perish."
msgstr ""
