msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.NEEDS.QUALITYOFLIFE.EXPECTATION_TOOLTIP"
msgid ""
"The more responsibilities and stressors a Duplicant has, the more they will desire additional leisure time and improved amenities.\n"
"\n"
"Failing to keep a Duplicant's <style=\"KKeyword\">Morale</style> at or above their <style=\"KKeyword\">Morale Need</style> means they will not be able to unwind, causing them <style=\"KKeyword\">Stress</style> over time."
msgstr ""
"فشل الحفاظ على \n"
"\n"
"كلما زادت المسؤوليات والضغوط على الدوبليكانت، زاد رغبتهم في وقت فراغ إضافي وتحسين وسائل الراحة.<style=\"KKeyword\">الروح المعنوية</style> للدوبليكانت عند مستوى <style=\"KKeyword\">االحتياج المعنوي</style> أو فوقه يعني أنهم لن يكونوا قادرين على االسترخاء، مما يسبب لهم <style=\"KKeyword\">التوتر</style> مع مرور الوقت."

msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.NEEDS.QUALITYOFLIFE.GOOD_MODIFIER"
msgid "High Morale"
msgstr "معنويات عالية"

msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.NEEDS.QUALITYOFLIFE.NAME"
msgid "Morale Requirements"
msgstr "متطلبات المعنويات"

msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.NEEDS.QUALITYOFLIFE.NEUTRAL_MODIFIER"
msgid "Sufficient Morale"
msgstr "معنويات كافية"

msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.NEEDS.QUALITYOFLIFE.TOTAL_SKILL_POINTS"
msgid "Total Skill Points: {0}"
msgstr "إجمالي نقاط المهارة: {0}"

msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.ABE.DESC"
msgid ""
"{0}s are sweet, delicate flowers. They need to be treated gingerly, with "
"great consideration for their feelings."
msgstr ""
"{0}.زهور حلوة ورقيقة. يجب التعامل معها بلطف، مع مراعاة كبيرة لمشاعرها s"

msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.ABE.NAME"
msgid "Abe"
msgstr "<size=11>إبراهيم (أبو خليل)</size>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.ADA.DESC"
msgid "{0}s enjoy writing poetry in their downtime. Dark poetry."
msgstr "{0}.يستمتعون بكتابة الشعر في أوقات فراغهم. شعر مظلم s"

msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.ADA.NAME"
msgid "Ada"
msgstr "<size=11>هدى</size>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.AMARI.DESC"
msgid "{0}s likes to keep the peace. Ironically, they're a riot at parties."
msgstr "يحب {0} الحفاظ على السالم. من المفارقات، أنه يكون مثيرا في الحفالت."

msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.AMARI.NAME"
msgid "Amari"
msgstr "<size=11>أميرة</size>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.ARI.DESC"
msgid ""
"{0}s tend to space out from time to time, but they always pay attention when"
" it counts."
msgstr ""
"{0} يميلون إلى التشتت من وقت آلخر، لكنهم دائما يولون اهتماما عندما يكون "
"األمر مهما."

msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.ARI.NAME"
msgid "Ari"
msgstr "<size=11>علي</size>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.ASHKAN.DESC"
msgid "{0}s have what can only be described as a \"seriously infectious giggle\"."
msgstr "{0} لديهم ما يمكن وصفه فقط بأنه \"قهقهة معدية جدا\"."

msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.ASHKAN.NAME"
msgid "Ashkan"
msgstr "<size=11>أشرف</size>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.BANHI.DESC"
msgid ""
"The \"cool loner\" vibes that radiate off a {0} never fail to make the "
"colony swoon."
msgstr ""
"الهالة 'المنعزلة الرائعة' التي تنبعث من {0} ال تفشل أبدا في جعل المستعمرة "
"تذوب إعجابا."

msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.BANHI.NAME"
msgid "Banhi"
msgstr "<size=11>بسمة</size>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.BUBBLES.DESC"
msgid ""
"This {0} is constantly challenging others to fight her, regardless of "
"whether or not she can actually take them."
msgstr ""
"هذه {0} تتحدى اآلخرين باستمرار للقتال معها، بغض النظر عما إذا كانت تستطيع "
"فعليا هزيمتهم أم ال."

msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.BUBBLES.NAME"
msgid "Bubbles"
msgstr "<size=11>بهيجة</size>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.BURT.DESC"
msgid "This {0} always feels great after a bubble bath and a good long cry."
msgstr "هذا {0} يشعر دائما بالروعة بعد حمام فقاعات وبكاء طويل جيد."

msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.BURT.NAME"
msgid "Burt"
msgstr "<size=11>بدر</size>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.CAMILLE.DESC"
msgid ""
"This {0} loves anything that makes her feel nostalgic, including things that"
" haven't aged well."
msgstr ""
"هذه {0} تحب أي شيء يجعلها تشعر بالحنين إلى الماضي، بما في ذلك األشياء التي "
"لم تتحسن مع مرور الوقت."

msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.CAMILLE.NAME"
msgid "Camille"
msgstr "<size=11>جميلة</size>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.CATALINA.DESC"
msgid ""
"A {0} is admired by all for her seemingly tireless work ethic. Little do "
"people know, she's dying on the inside."
msgstr ""
"تحظى {0} بإعجاب الجميع ألخالقيات العمل التي تبدو ال تتعبها. وقليل من الناس "
"يعلمون أنها تموت داخليا."

msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.CATALINA.NAME"
msgid "Catalina"
msgstr "<size=11>كريمة</size>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.CHIP.DESC"
msgid "This {0} is extremely good at guessing their friends' passwords."
msgstr "هذا {0} جيد جدا في تخمين كلمات مرور أصدقائهم."

msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.CHIP.NAME"
msgid "Chip"
msgstr "<size=11>شريف</size>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.DEVON.DESC"
msgid ""
"This {0} dreams of owning their own personal computer so they can start a "
"blog full of pictures of toast."
msgstr ""
"يحلم هذا {0} بامتالك جهاز كمبيوتر شخصي خاص بهم حتى يتمكنوا من بدء مدونة "
"مليئة بصور الخبز المحمص."

msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.DEVON.NAME"
msgid "Devon"
msgstr "<size=11>داوود</size>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.EDWIREDO.DESC"
msgid ""
"This {0} once rolled his eye so hard that he powered himself off and on "
"again."
msgstr ""
"هذا {0} دفع بعينيه مرة واحدة بقوة لدرجة أنه أوقف تشغيل نفسه ثم شغلها مرة "
"أخرى."

msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.EDWIREDO.NAME"
msgid "Edwiredo"
msgstr "<size=11>عادل</size>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.ELLIE.DESC"
msgid ""
"Nothing makes an {0} happier than a big tin of glitter and a pack of unicorn"
" stickers."
msgstr ""
"ال شيء يجعل {0} أسعد من علبة كبيرة من البريق وعبوة من ملصقات اليونيكورن."

msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.ELLIE.NAME"
msgid "Ellie"
msgstr "<size=11>إلهام</size>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.FRANKIE.DESC"
msgid ""
"There's nothing {0}s are more proud of than their thick, dignified eyebrows."
msgstr "ال شيء يفتخر به {0} أكثر من حواجبهم الكثيفة والوقورة."

msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.FRANKIE.NAME"
msgid "Frankie"
msgstr "<size=11>فريد</size>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.FREYJA.DESC"
msgid "This {0} has never stopped anyone from eating yellow snow."
msgstr "هذا {0} لم يمنع أحدا أبدا من أكل الثلج األصفر."

msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.FREYJA.NAME"
msgid "Freyja"
msgstr "<size=11>فريال</size>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.GIZMO.DESC"
msgid "{0}s love nothing more than a big juicy info dump."
msgstr "ال يحب {0}.شيائ أكثر من تراكم كبير وعصيري من المعلومات s"

msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.GIZMO.NAME"
msgid "Gizmo"
msgstr "<size=11>عزت</size>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.GOSSMANN.DESC"
msgid "{0}s are major goofballs who can make anyone laugh."
msgstr "{0}.هم مهرجون رئيسيون يمكنهم جعل أي شخص يضحك s"

msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.GOSSMANN.NAME"
msgid "Gossmann"
msgstr "<size=11>غسان</size>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.HAROLD.DESC"
msgid ""
"Get a bunch of {0}s together in a room, and you'll have... a bunch of {0}s "
"together in a room."
msgstr "اجمع مجموعة من {0} في غرفة، وستحصل على... مجموعة من {0} في غرفة."

msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.HAROLD.NAME"
msgid "Harold"
msgstr "<size=11>هادي</size>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.HASSAN.DESC"
msgid ""
"If someone says something nice to a {0} he'll think about it nonstop for no "
"less than three weeks."
msgstr ""
"إذا قال شخص ما شيائ لطيفا لـ {0} فسيفكر فيه بال توقف لمدة ال تقل عن ثالثة "
"أسابيع."

msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.HASSAN.NAME"
msgid "Hassan"
msgstr "<size=11>حسن</size>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.HIGBY.DESC"
msgid ""
"This {0}'s got a song in his heart. Now if only he could remember how it "
"goes."
msgstr "هذا {0} لديه أغنية في قلبه. اآلن إذا كان فقط يستطيع تذكر كيف تسير."

msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.HIGBY.NAME"
msgid "Higby"
msgstr "<size=11>هاني</size>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.JEAN.DESC"
msgid ""
"Just because {0}s are a little slow doesn't mean they can't suffer from "
"soul-crushing existential crises."
msgstr ""
"مجرد أن {0} بطيء قليال ال يعني أنهم ال يستطيعون المعاناة من أزمات وجودية "
"محطمة للروح."

msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.JEAN.NAME"
msgid "Jean"
msgstr "<size=11>جمال</size>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.JORGE.DESC"
msgid ""
"{0} loves his new colony, even if their collective body odor makes his eyes "
"water."
msgstr ""
"{0} يحب مستعمرته الجديدة، حتى لو كانت رائحة أجسادهم مجتمعة تجعل عينيه تدمع."

msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.JORGE.NAME"
msgid "Jorge"
msgstr "<size=11>جورج</size>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.JOSHUA.DESC"
msgid ""
"{0}s are precious goobers. Other Duplicants are strangely incapable of "
"cursing in a {0}'s presence."
msgstr ""
"{0} أغبياء ثمينة. التكرارات األخرى غير قادرة بشكل غريب على اللعنة في وجود "
"{0}."

msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.JOSHUA.NAME"
msgid "Joshua"
msgstr "<size=11>يوسف</size>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.LEIRA.DESC"
msgid "{0}s just want everyone to be happy."
msgstr "{0}.يريدون فقط أن يكون الجميع سعداء s"

msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.LEIRA.NAME"
msgid "Leira"
msgstr "<size=11>لارا</size>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.LIAM.DESC"
msgid "No matter how much this {0} scrubs, he can never truly feel clean."
msgstr "مهما فرك هذا {0} بشدة، لن يشعر بالنظافة حقا."

msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.LIAM.NAME"
msgid "Liam"
msgstr "<size=11>ليث</size>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.LINDSAY.DESC"
msgid ""
"A {0} is a charming woman, unless you make the mistake of messing with one "
"of her friends."
msgstr "المرأة {0} هي امرأة ساحرة، ما لم ترتكب خطأ المماطلة مع أحد أصدقائها."

msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.LINDSAY.NAME"
msgid "Lindsay"
msgstr "<size=11>لميس</size>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.MAE.DESC"
msgid "There's nothing a {0} can't do if she sets her mind to it."
msgstr "ال يوجد شيء ال تستطيع {0} فعله إذا عزمت على ذلك."

msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.MAE.NAME"
msgid "Mae"
msgstr "<size=11>مي</size>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.MARIE.DESC"
msgid ""
"This {0} is positively glowing! What's her secret? Radioactive isotopes, of "
"course."
msgstr "هذا {0} يلمع بشكل إيجابي! ما سره؟ النظائر المشعة، بالطبع."

msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.MARIE.NAME"
msgid "Marie"
msgstr "<size=11>مريم</size>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.MAX.DESC"
msgid ""
"At any given moment a {0} is viscerally reliving ten different humiliating "
"memories."
msgstr "في أي لحظة معينة، يعيد {0} عيش عشر ذكريات مهينة مختلفة بشكل غريزي."

msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.MAX.NAME"
msgid "Max"
msgstr "<size=11>مازن</size>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.MAYA.DESC"
msgid ""
"This {0} got her hand crushed in a pneumatic door once. It was the most "
"alive she's ever felt."
msgstr ""
"لقد انسدت يد هذه {0} في باب هوائي مرة واحدة. كانت أكثر شعور بالحياة شعرت به "
"على اإلطالق."

msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.MAYA.NAME"
msgid "Maya"
msgstr "<size=11>ميساء</size>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.MEEP.DESC"
msgid "{0}s have a face only a two tonne Printing Pod could love."
msgstr "{0}.طباعة يزن طنين doP لديهم وجه ال يستطيع حبه إال s"

msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.MEEP.NAME"
msgid "Meep"
msgstr "<size=11>مسعود</size>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.MIMA.DESC"
msgid "Ol' {0} here can't stand lookin' at people's knees."
msgstr "القديم {0} هنا ال يستطيع تحمل النظر إلى ركب الناس."

msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.MIMA.NAME"
msgid "Mi-Ma"
msgstr "<size=11>ميادة</size>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.NAILS.DESC"
msgid ""
"People often expect a Duplicant named \"{0}\" to be tough, but they're all "
"pretty huge wimps."
msgstr ""
"غالبا ما يتوقع الناس أن يكون المكرر المسمى \"{0}\" قويا، لكنهم جميعا ضعفاء "
"جدا."

msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.NAILS.NAME"
msgid "Nails"
msgstr "<size=11>نائل</size>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.NIKOLA.DESC"
msgid ""
"This {0} once claimed he could build a laser so powerful it would rip the "
"colony in half. No one asked him to prove it."
msgstr ""
"ادعى هذا {0} ذات مرة أنه يمكنه بناء ليزر قوي جدا بحيث يمزق المستعمرة إلى "
"نصفين. لم يطلب منه أحد إثبات ذلك."

msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.NIKOLA.NAME"
msgid "Nikola"
msgstr "<size=11>نادر</size>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.NISBET.DESC"
msgid ""
"This {0} likes to punch people to show her affection. Everyone's too afraid "
"of her to tell her it hurts."
msgstr ""
"هذا {0} يحب ضرب الناس ليظهر لها المودة. الجميع خائفون جدا منها ليخبروها أنه "
"يؤلم."

msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.NISBET.NAME"
msgid "Nisbet"
msgstr "<size=11>نسيبة</size>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.OTTO.DESC"
msgid ""
"{0}s always insult people by accident and generally exist in a perpetual "
"state of deep regret."
msgstr ""
"{0} دائما يسيء إلى الناس عن طريق الخطأ وبشكل عام يعيش في حالة مستمرة من "
"الندم العميق."

msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.OTTO.NAME"
msgid "Otto"
msgstr "<size=11>عطية</size>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.PEI.DESC"
msgid ""
"Every {0} spends at least half the day pretending that they remember what "
"they came into this room for."
msgstr ""
"كل {0} يقضي على األقل نصف اليوم متظاهرا بأنهم يتذكرون لماذا دخلوا هذه "
"الغرفة."

msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.PEI.NAME"
msgid "Pei"
msgstr "<size=11>بهاء</size>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.QUINN.DESC"
msgid "This {0}'s favorite genre of music is \"festive power ballad\"."
