msgctxt "STRINGS.GAMEPLAY_EVENTS.EVENT_TYPES.PARTY.DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"THIS EVENT IS NOT WORKING\n"
"{host} is throwing a birthday party for {dupe}. Make sure there is an available Recreation Room for the party.\n"
"\n"
"Social events are good for Duplicant morale. Rejecting this party will hurt {host} and {dupe}'s fragile ego."
