msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.UISIDESCREENS.SELFDESTRUCTSIDESCREEN.BUTTON_TOOLTIP"
msgid ""
"This rocket is equipped with an emergency escape system.\n"
"\n"
"The rocket's self-destruct sequence can be triggered to destroy it and propel fragments of the ship towards the nearest planetoid.\n"
"\n"
"Any Duplicants on board will be safely delivered in escape pods."
msgstr ""
"أي نسخ متطابقة على متن السفينة سيتم إيصالها بأمان في كبسوالت الهروب.\n"
"\n"
